Package: silcsdc
Title: Statistical Disclosure Control on EU-SILC Public Microdata
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Simone", "Mezzabotta", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Measures re-identification risk in a person-level EU-SILC file,
    protects it with sdcMicro (global recoding, local suppression,
    microaggregation), quantifies the information loss on official indicators,
    and protects a magnitude table with primary and secondary cell suppression
    using sdcTable.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    data.table,
    digest,
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    pkgload,
    sdcHierarchies,
    sdcMicro,
    sdcTable
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
